{
  "movie_id": 509200101,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 1.1,
      "end_time": 5.4,
      "text": "はじめまして、私、ランドソルで占い師をやっている"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 5.6,
      "end_time": 7.1,
      "text": "シノブと申します"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 7.4,
      "end_time": 8.6,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 8.8,
      "end_time": 11.6,
      "text": "ふ、ふーん、占い師、ね"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 12.3,
      "end_time": 14.5,
      "text": "で、占い師が私に何の用だ？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 15.3,
      "end_time": 20.6,
      "text": "はい、かの有名な疾風の冥姫とぜひお話したいと思いまして"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 21.0,
      "end_time": 24.0,
      "text": "ほ、ほほう？　私と、ね"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 24.3,
      "end_time": 26.6,
      "text": "なかなか見所があるではないか"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 27.2,
      "end_time": 28.5,
      "text": "Thank you very much!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 29.0,
      "end_time": 33.0,
      "text": "……ところで今回の旅は誰かご一緒ではないのですか？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 34.2,
      "end_time": 36.6,
      "text": "……ふっ、強者とは孤独なもの"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 36.8,
      "end_time": 40.0,
      "text": "いつだってそうさ、いつだってな……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 40.2,
      "end_time": 41.2,
      "text": "そうですか"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 41.5,
      "end_time": 45.2,
      "text": "ぜひとも同行させていただけないかと思ったのですが……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 45.5,
      "end_time": 46.7,
      "text": "残念です"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 47.2,
      "end_time": 48.6,
      "text": "ま、待つがいい！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 48.8,
      "end_time": 50.4,
      "text": "そう結論を急ぐな"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 51.1,
      "end_time": 53.1,
      "text": "話を、話をしようじゃないか！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 53.3,
      "end_time": 57.2,
      "text": "（シノブさん、占い師だけあって人の扱いが上手いなぁ）"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 58.4,
      "end_time": 60.5,
      "text": "貴様の望みは分かった"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 60.7,
      "end_time": 63.6,
      "text": "だが、我が道はまさに修羅道"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 63.8,
      "end_time": 67.2,
      "text": "はたして占い師についてこられるかどうか……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 67.4,
      "end_time": 71.6,
      "text": "それでしたら占いの他にも霊視や除霊なども可能です"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 72.5,
      "end_time": 74.6,
      "text": "決して足手まといにはならないかと"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 75.2,
      "end_time": 77.5,
      "text": "き、貴様は霊媒師なのか！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 78.5,
      "end_time": 80.0,
      "text": "なんという僥倖！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 80.2,
      "end_time": 82.5,
      "text": "これほどの逸材、逃してなるものか！"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 84.2,
      "end_time": 85.0,
      "text": "おほん……"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 85.2,
      "end_time": 87.5,
      "text": "ええと、シノブ、と言ったな"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 87.7,
      "end_time": 88.3,
      "text": "Correct!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 88.5,
      "end_time": 89.6,
      "text": "それでお返事は……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 89.8,
      "end_time": 91.0,
      "text": "いいだろう"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 91.2,
      "end_time": 93.1,
      "text": "共に歩むことを許そう！"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 93.4,
      "end_time": 94.6,
      "text": "Thank you very much!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 95.1,
      "end_time": 99.1,
      "text": "世に名高き疾風の冥姫との旅は一生の誉れ──"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 99.3,
      "end_time": 101.5,
      "text": "ではこれより降衣の儀を行う！"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 101.7,
      "end_time": 102.7,
      "text": "え、あの……"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 103.5,
      "end_time": 104.6,
      "text": "一体何を……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 105.5,
      "end_time": 106.2,
      "text": "Eek!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 113.8,
      "end_time": 114.5,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 121.0,
      "end_time": 123.5,
      "text": "ふっふっふっふっふ"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 123.7,
      "end_time": 126.0,
      "text": "へぇ、素敵じゃないか"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 127.0,
      "end_time": 127.6,
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 127.8,
      "end_time": 129.2,
      "text": "おー出てきたまえ"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 130.3,
      "end_time": 133.0,
      "text": "この衣装は一体……"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start_time": 134.0,
      "end_time": 138.5,
      "text": "これは七つの海を統べし王者の魂を宿した戦闘服"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start_time": 139.8,
      "end_time": 143.3,
      "text": "そしてそれが相棒と認めし者に託す服だ"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start_time": 144.5,
      "end_time": 147.1,
      "text": "どうだ、心が震えるだろ？"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start_time": 148.0,
      "end_time": 150.0,
      "text": "よく分かりませんが"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start_time": 152.9,
      "end_time": 154.5,
      "text": "恥ずかしいです……"
    }
  ],
